IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PROG-PAGED-ATTN.

DATA DIVISION.
01 SEQ-LEN             PIC 9(9) USAGE R0.
01 BLOCK-SIZE          PIC 9(9) USAGE R1.
01 NEEDED-BLOCKS       PIC 9(9) USAGE R2.
01 FRAG-PCT-X10        PIC 9(9) USAGE R3.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PAGED-ATTN.
    IF BLOCK-SIZE == 0
        GO TO ERROR-EXIT.
    END-IF.

    COMPUTE NEEDED-BLOCKS = (SEQ-LEN + BLOCK-SIZE - 1) / BLOCK-SIZE.
    COMPUTE FRAG-PCT-X10 = ((BLOCK-SIZE - (SEQ-LEN - ((NEEDED-BLOCKS - 1) * BLOCK-SIZE))) * 1000) / (NEEDED-BLOCKS * BLOCK-SIZE).

    SET depth 3.
    WEIGHT 32 NEEDED-BLOCKS.
    WEIGHT 30 FRAG-PCT-X10.
    EVAL.
    PRUNE 10.
    GO TO END-STRATEGY.

ERROR-EXIT.
    SET depth 0.
    EVAL.

END-STRATEGY.
